{"3437010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Reaper Recon", "steam_appid": 3437010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaper Recons</strong> is a fast-paced, third-person arcade shooter that throws you into the heart of an abandoned research facility teeming with the undead. Lock and load as you battle through relentless waves of enemies in a test of reflexes and firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage a variety of enemy types—from quick, one-hit threats to explosive variants—each adding intensity to the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fully traversable map as you fight to survive. Collect powerful weapons, grab ability pick-ups, and gain the edge as the difficulty escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in. Wipe them out. Reap the results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras/183d92d83fe1efe0328c22a77056dea3.avif?t=1774721899\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras_big/183d92d83fe1efe0328c22a77056dea3.webp?t=1774721899 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras/851346a5505fcde69dcf341e77f20aad.avif?t=1774721899\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras_big/851346a5505fcde69dcf341e77f20aad.webp?t=1774721899 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437010/extras/f6067feb6ecca2dc2cf39bf7215980ea.avif?t=1774721899\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s